{"version":1,"content":"<p>旅發局今年首辦「香港萬聖月」，多項活動將於10月17日本周六開始。</p><p>其中全港最大規模跨區Cosplay街頭派對，10月17日起一連3個周六在5區（中環皇后像廣場花園及遮打道、蘭桂坊、啟德體育園、旺角朗豪坊及尖東麼地道花園）舉行。</p><p>本文綜合各地點活動一覽。</p><p>【旅發局萬聖月活動詳情】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T03:39:34.988522+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:37:40.285325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:37:37.438137+00:00","content_hash":"935c5dbd51af4f154bd2ba913a8251858054104a39796cc2a0db9260477bf919","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}